{% extends "web/base.html.j2" %}
{% set page_title = "WaveformAnalysis 文档" %}
{% set asset_prefix = "assets/" %}
{% set site_root_prefix = "" %}
{% set body_class = "docs-page docs-home" %}
{% set current = "home" %}
{% set site_home_href = "index.html" %}
{% set plugin_index_href = "plugins/index.html" %}
{% set accessor_index_href = "accessors/index.html" %}
{% set context_index_href = "contexts/index.html" %}
{% set visualization_index_href = "visualizations/index.html" %}
{% set accessor_detail_prefix = "accessors/" %}
{% block document %}
<main class="docs-main">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="面包屑"><span aria-current="page">文档概览</span></nav>
  <section class="home-intro"><p class="eyebrow">WaveformAnalysis</p><h1>波形分析文档</h1><p>从数据采集到事件构建，查看可组合的插件处理链与面向分析的只读查询接口。</p><div class="home-actions"><a class="button-link" href="contexts/context.html">了解 Context</a><a class="text-link" href="plugins/index.html">浏览插件系统</a></div></section>
  <section class="home-section" id="context-and-plugin" aria-labelledby="context-and-plugin-heading"><p class="eyebrow">核心模型</p><h2 id="context-and-plugin-heading">Context 调度，Plugin 产出数据</h2><p><code>Context</code> 是每次分析的入口，管理配置、已注册插件、依赖解析和缓存。它不保存隐式当前运行；每次数据访问由调用方显式传入 <code>run_id</code>。每个 <code>Plugin</code> 声明一个稳定的数据产物及其上游依赖；Context 将这些声明组织为 DAG，并仅在请求某个产物时执行所需链路。</p><div class="resource-grid home-concept-grid"><div class="resource-card home-concept-card"><span class="category">调度与状态</span><h3>Context</h3><p>集中管理数据根目录、DAQ adapter、依赖解析和缓存生命周期。</p></div><div class="resource-card home-concept-card"><span class="category">处理单元</span><h3>Plugin</h3><p>将原始输入逐步转换为 records、hits、peaks、events 等具名产物。</p></div><div class="resource-card home-concept-card"><span class="category">依赖关系</span><h3>Plugin DAG</h3><p>下游请求会自动解析上游依赖；已命中的内存或磁盘缓存会被复用。</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="home-section" id="minimal-workflow" aria-labelledby="minimal-workflow-heading"><p class="eyebrow">最小流程</p><h2 id="minimal-workflow-heading">注册插件，再请求数据</h2><p>先创建 Context 并注册一组插件，再通过 <code>get_data()</code> 请求目标产物。无需手动按顺序调用每个插件；请求 <code>peaks</code> 时，Context 会解析并执行缺失的上游数据。</p><pre class="code-block language-python"><code>{{ context_plugin_example_html }}</code></pre><aside class="home-note"><p><strong>配置原则：</strong>显式设置全局 <code>daq_adapter</code>；插件行为参数由 Context 的配置解析器按显式配置、adapter 推断和插件默认值的顺序处理。</p></aside></section>
  <section class="home-section" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="eyebrow">开始浏览</p><h2 id="start-heading">按工作流定位文档</h2><p>插件声明依赖并负责执行处理，产出可复用的数据结果；Accessor 不属于插件 DAG，而是在分析阶段通过 Context 辅助查询、整理、筛选和可视化插件产物。通常先由插件完成处理，再用 Accessor 定位和检查所需结果。</p><div class="resource-grid"><a class="resource-card" href="contexts/context.html"><span class="category">分析运行时</span><h3>Context</h3><p>配置、数据访问、DAG 与缓存诊断接口。</p></a><a class="resource-card" href="plugins/index.html"><span class="category">处理系统</span><h3>插件参考</h3><p>搜索插件、检查输出字段、配置项与默认依赖谱系。</p></a><a class="resource-card" href="accessors/index.html"><span class="category">分析接口</span><h3>Accessor</h3><p>查询 peak 通道与 S1-S2 配对结果。</p></a><a class="resource-card" href="visualizations/index.html"><span class="category">可视化</span><h3>统计图与波形图</h3><p>创建 corner 图、选择曲线与波形检查。</p></a></div></section>
  <section class="home-section home-note" aria-labelledby="offline-heading"><p class="eyebrow">本地优先</p><h2 id="offline-heading">无需网络即可阅读</h2><p>站点由 <code>waveform-docs generate site-web</code> 生成；图谱、搜索与代码高亮全部使用本地资源。</p></section>
</main>
{% endblock %}
